# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Part 1: End-of-circuit detection {#part-1-end-of-circuit-detection}"
msgstr "Part 1: End-of-circuit detection {#part-1-end-of-circuit-detection}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-18
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In Part 1, we focus on methods in which all check information is read out at the end of the circuit. We consider two strategies under this constraint:\n"
msgstr "Sa Part 1, nakatuon tayo sa mga paraan kung saan binabasa sa dulo ng circuit ang lahat ng impormasyon ng check. Dalawang strategy ang isinasaalang-alang natin sa ilalim ng limitasyong ito:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-18
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Symmetry post-selection: the simplest but most limited form ([Section 1.1](#symmetry-post-selection)). The check is a rule applied to the measured bitstring, and the original circuit is run unchanged, with no extra qubits, and no encoding. This requires prior knowledge of the ideal output distribution, and the data is consumed by the final measurement before the check is applied.\n"
msgstr "Symmetry post-selection: ang pinakasimple pero pinakalimitadong anyo ([Seksyon 1.1](#symmetry-post-selection)). Ang check ay isang rule na inilalapat sa nasukat na bitstring, at pinapatakbo ang orihinal na circuit nang walang pagbabago, walang dagdag na qubit, at walang encoding. Nangangailangan ito ng paunang kaalaman sa ideal na output distribution, at nauubos ang data ng huling measurement bago mailapat ang check.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-18
#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Stabilizer-code post-selection with syndrome qubits ([Section 1.2](#stabilizer-code)). The check is the outcome of an ancilla measurement appended to the circuit. This adds qubits and gates, but does not require knowing the full output distribution and can detect both bit-flip and phase-flip Pauli errors.\n"
msgstr "Stabilizer-code post-selection na may mga syndrome qubit ([Seksyon 1.2](#stabilizer-code)). Ang check ay ang resulta ng ancilla measurement na idinagdag sa circuit. Nagdaragdag ito ng mga qubit at gate, pero hindi kailangang alam ang buong output distribution at kaya nitong mag-detect ng parehong bit-flip at phase-flip na Pauli error.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-18
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Both strategies are post-selected: a flagged shot is discarded, and no correction is attempted. [Section 1.3](#limitations) outlines three limitations of end-of-circuit detection that motivate the interior-check constructions of Part 2.\n"
msgstr "Parehong post-selected ang dalawang strategy: itinatapon ang shot na namarkahan, at walang pagtatangkang itama. Binabalangkas ng [Seksyon 1.3](#limitations) ang tatlong limitasyon ng end-of-circuit detection na nagtutulak sa mga interior-check construction ng Part 2.\n"

