#, no-wrap
msgid "*Post-selection rate* $A$ (also called *acceptance rate*): the fraction of shots that satisfy the check.\n"
msgstr "*Post-selection rate* $A$ (tinatawag ding *acceptance rate*): ang bahagi ng mga shot na pumasa sa check.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-18
