msgid "Run the 10-qubit GHZ circuit on the hardware backend.\n"
msgstr "Patakbuhin ang 10-qubit na GHZ circuit sa hardware backend.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-18
