# doq: translated after an English change 2026-10-13 · verified 2026-10-18
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The conjugation produces a different Pauli operator with larger weight and a support that no longer coincides with that of $R$. Even modest weight increases can become costly after transpilation: the controlled-Pauli gates for $L$ could target qubits poorly aligned with the hardware connectivity, forcing extra routing depth. We now assemble the full CPC circuit ($L$ check, payload, $R$ check on a single ancilla) and measure exactly that overhead after transpilation.\n"
msgstr "Gumagawa ang conjugation ng ibang Pauli operator na mas malaki ang weight at may support na hindi na kapareho ng sa $R$. Kahit katamtamang pagtaas ng weight ay maaaring maging magastos pagkatapos ng transpilation: ang mga controlled-Pauli gate para sa $L$ ay maaaring tumarget ng mga qubit na hindi maayos na nakahanay sa hardware connectivity, na pumipilit ng karagdagang routing depth. Binubuo natin ngayon ang buong CPC circuit ($L$ check, payload, $R$ check sa iisang ancilla) at sinusukat ang eksaktong overhead na iyon pagkatapos ng transpilation.\n"

